(1, 'Kawah Ijen Banyuwangi (Blue Fire)', 'Kawah Ijen Banyuwangi (Blue Fire)', 'kawah-ijen-banyuwangi-1777866389', 'tour_packages/Nc5l0dT8VCHkbiZEPSMutUffdJkjq6ZsxmoSNJF7.webp', 2, 3, NULL, 250000, 550000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 Day', '1 Day', '<p>Kawah Ijen (Blue Fire)</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati indah nya kawah belerang dengan api birunya dan menikmati sunrise di punjak kawah ijen</p>', '<p>Enjoy the beauty of the sulfur crater with its blue flames and the sunrise at the peak of the Ijen crater.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Stasiun Banyuwangi Kota, Hotel, Terminal</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Banyuwangi City Meeting Point</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Saturday &amp; Sunday (weekends)</p>', '<p>00.30 Peserta Open Trip Kawah Ijen dijemput di area Stasiun, Terminal, atau hotel sekitar Kota Banyuwangi. 01.00 Perjalanan menuju kawasan wisata Kawah Ijen Banyuwangi dimulai. 02.00 Tiba di Pos Paltuding, kemudian persiapan dan memulai pendakian menuju area kawah. 04.00 Sampai di puncak Kawah Ijen. Peserta dapat menyaksikan fenomena langka Blue Fire, menikmati panorama sunrise, melihat keindahan danau kawah berwarna hijau tosca, serta berfoto di berbagai spot menarik. 06.30 Pendakian turun kembali menuju Pos Paltuding. 07.45 Tiba di Pos Paltuding, selanjutnya perjalanan kembali menuju Kota Banyuwangi. 09.00 Pengantaran peserta ke stasiun atau hotel di sekitar Kota Banyuwangi. Trip selesai.</p>', '<p><strong>12:30 AM</strong> Ijen Crater Open Trip participants will be picked up at the station, terminal, or hotels around Banyuwangi City.<br><strong>1:00 AM</strong> The journey to the Ijen Crater tourist area in Banyuwangi begins.<br><strong>2:00 AM</strong> Arrive at Paltuding Post, prepare for the climb, and begin the climb to the crater.<br><strong>4:00 AM</strong> Arrive at the summit of Ijen Crater. Participants can witness the rare Blue Fire phenomenon, enjoy the panoramic sunrise, admire the beautiful turquoise crater lake, and take photos at various points of interest.<br><strong>6:30 AM</strong> Descend back to Paltuding Post.<br><strong>7:45 AM</strong> Arrive at Paltuding Post, then return to Banyuwangi City.<br><strong>9:00 AM </strong>Drop participants off at the station or hotel around Banyuwangi City.<br>Trip complete.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Tiket Masuk, Mobil, Maker Gass,</p>', '<p>Car + Driver<br>Ijen Local Guide<br>Entrance Ticket<br>Gas Mask &amp; Flashlight<br>Mineral Water (Drinks)</p>', '<p>Surat Keterangan Sehat</p>', '<p>Health Certificate<br>Photographic documentation (please ask your guide)<br>Foreigner Ticket<br>Insurance<br>Personal expenses<br>Guide tips (as you wish)</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-03 20:46:29', '2026-05-28 18:07:05'),
(2, 'Green Island Banyuwangi  (Mini Raja Ampat)', 'Green Island Banyuwangi  (Mini Raja Ampat)', 'green-island-banyuwangi-mini-raja-ampat-1777867189', NULL, 1, 3, NULL, 475000, 750000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 Day', '1 Day', '<p>Green Island (Mini Raja Ampat)</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>kamu akan diajak menjelajahi dan menikmati indahnya Green Island (miniatur Raja Ampat), Spot T, hingga keasrian Pantai Wedi Ireng. Open Trip Green Island Banyuwangi sifatnya open trip/sharing jadi akan digabung dengan peserta lain.</p>', '<p>You will be invited to explore and enjoy the beauty of Green Island (a miniature Raja Ampat), Spot T, and the pristine Wedi Ireng Beach. The Green Island Banyuwangi Open Trip is an open trip/sharing trip, so you will be joining other participants.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Stasiun Banyuwangi Kota, Hotel, Terminal</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Saturday &amp; Sunday (weekend)</p>', '<p>06.30 – 08.00 Penjemputan peserta di area Kota Banyuwangi (hotel/stasiun/bandara), dilanjutkan perjalanan menuju Pantai Mustika Pesanggaran. 08.00 Peserta berkumpul di Pantai Mustika Pesanggaran Banyuwangi dan persiapan penyeberangan. 08.30 Penyeberangan dari Pantai Mustika menuju Green Island Banyuwangi menggunakan perahu nelayan (±15 menit). 08.45 Tiba di Green Island, dilanjutkan trekking menuju spot puncak untuk menikmati panorama alam yang dijuluki miniatur Raja Ampat Banyuwangi. 10.00 Turun dari puncak Green Island, kemudian bergeser menggunakan perahu menuju Spot T. 10.30 Tiba di Spot T. Jika kondisi ombak memungkinkan, peserta dapat menikmati pemandangan gugusan pulau kecil dari atas perahu sekaligus berfoto. 11.00 Melanjutkan perjalanan menuju Pantai Wedi Ireng. Catatan: kunjungan menyesuaikan kondisi ombak pada hari pelaksanaan. Jika ombak besar, destinasi akan dialihkan kembali ke Pantai Mustika. 11.30 Tiba di Pantai Wedi Ireng. Waktu bebas untuk menikmati keindahan pantai berpasir putih dan air laut yang jernih. 13.00 Meninggalkan Pantai Wedi Ireng dan kembali menuju Pantai Mustika. 13.30 Tiba di Pantai Mustika Pesanggaran. Trip selesai.</p>', '<p><strong>6:30 AM</strong> Pick up participants in the Banyuwangi City area (hotel/train station/airport), then proceed to Mustika Pesanggaran Beach.<br><strong>8:00 AM</strong> Participants gather at Mustika Pesanggaran Beach in Banyuwangi and prepare for the crossing.<br><strong>8:30 AM</strong> Cross from Mustika Beach to Green Island Banyuwangi by fishing boat (approximately 15 minutes).<br><strong>8:45 AM</strong> Arrive at Green Island and continue trekking to the summit to enjoy the panoramic view, dubbed a miniature Raja Ampat in Banyuwangi.<br><strong>10:00 AM</strong> Descend from the summit of Green Island and transfer by boat to Spot T.<br><strong>10:30 AM</strong> Arrive at Spot T. If wave conditions permit, participants can enjoy the view of the small island cluster from the boat and take photos.<br><strong>11:00 AM</strong> Continue the journey to Wedi Ireng Beach. Note: The trip is subject to wave conditions on the day of the event. If the waves are high, the destination will be diverted back to Mustika Beach.<br><strong>11:30</strong> Arrive at Wedi Ireng Beach. Free time to enjoy the beauty of the white sandy beach and crystal clear waters.<br><strong>1:00 PM</strong> Leave Wedi Ireng Beach and return to Mustika Beach.<br><strong>1:30 PM</strong> Arrive at Mustika Pesanggaran Beach. Trip complete.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Perahu, Tiket Masuk, Guide, Air Mineral, life jacket</p>', '<p>Boat to Green Island, Spot T, Wedi Ireng Beach<br>Local Guide<br>Mineral water (drinks)</p>', '<p>makan</p>', '<p>Boat to Green Island, Spot T, Wedi Ireng Beach<br>Local Guide<br>Mineral water<br>Life jacket</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, '2026-05-03 20:59:49', '2026-05-28 18:07:05'),
(3, 'Tabuhan & Menjangan Island', 'Tabuhan & Menjangan Island', 'tabuhan-menjangan-1777877553', NULL, 1, 3, NULL, 295000, 1099998.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 Day', '1 Day', '<p>Tabuhan &amp; Menjangan Island</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Kamu akan di ajak untuk berenang/ snorkeling dan melihat keindahan bawah laut Pulau Menjangan dan eksotisme Pulau Tabuhan Banyuwangi. Paket Open Trip/Sharing dimana kamu akan digabung dengan peserta lain, yang pasti kamu akan mendapatkan teman baru.</p>', '<p>See the underwater beauty of Menjangan Island and the exoticism of Tabuhan Island, Banyuwangi. An Open Trip/Sharing Package where you\'ll be joined by other participants, and you\'re sure to make new friends.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Pantai Grand Watu Dodol Banyuwangi, pukul 08.00 WIB Maps : https://maps.app.goo.gl/7iHxPSv3x4WtQLoh7</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>setiap hari</p>', '<p>Saturday &amp; Sunday (weekend)</p>', '<p>07:30 Peserta Open trip berkumpul di Meeting Point Grand Watu Dodol 08.00 Persiapan dan briefing peserta open trip 08:15 Menyeberang ke pulau Menjangan dan menikmati view pasir putih serta gradasi pantai Taman Nasional Bali Barat 09:00 Registrasi pengunjung, dilanjut agenda bebas dan peserta trip bisa take foto di beberapa spot yang ada pulau Menjangan dan takat pasir 10:00 Kembali ke kapal dan dilanjutkan Snorkeling di spot pertama 11:00 Snorkeling di spot kedua 12:30 Meninggalkan kawasan Pulau Menjangan untuk menuju Pulau Tabuhan 13:15 Mengunjungi pulau Tabuhan, dan Makan Siang (lunch box). Peserta open trip bisa explore keindahan pulau Tabuhan dan agenda free time 14:30 Meninggalkan pulau Tabuhan 15:00 Sampai di meeting point Grand Watu Dodol anda bisa bilas – bilas di toilet yang ada dan paket open trip menjangan tabuhan selesai</p>', '<p><strong>7:30 AM</strong> Open trip participants gather at the Grand Watu Dodol Meeting Point.<br><strong>8:00 AM</strong> Preparation and briefing for open trip participants.<br><strong>8:15 AM</strong> Cross to Menjangan Island and enjoy the white sand and gradation of the West Bali National Park coast.<br><strong>9:00 AM</strong> Visitor registration, followed by free activities, and trip participants can take photos at several spots on Menjangan Island and the sand dunes.<br><strong>10:00 AM</strong> Return to the boat and continue snorkeling at the first spot.<br><strong>11:00 AM</strong> Snorkeling at the second spot.<br><strong>12:30 PM</strong> Leave Menjangan Island for Tabuhan Island.<br><strong>1:15 PM</strong> Visit Tabuhan Island and have lunch (lunch box). Open trip participants can explore the beauty of Tabuhan Island and enjoy free time.<br><strong>2:30 PM</strong> Depart Tabuhan Island.<br><strong>3:00 PM</strong> Arrive at the Grand Watu Dodol meeting point. You can use the restrooms provided, and the Menjangan Tabuhan open trip package is complete.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Kapal wisata Izin kegiatan snorkeling Izin dan tiket masuk pulau Guide dan instruktur Konsumsi Masker Snorkel Jaket pelampung Dokumentasi underwater</p>', '<p>Tour boat<br>Snorkeling permit<br>Island permit and entrance fee<br>Guide and instructor<br>Consumables<br>Snorkel mask<br>Life jacket<br>Underwater documentation</p>', '<p>Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket Pengeluaran pribadi Tips guide (seikhlasnya)</p>', '<p>Foreign Tourist Ticket<br>Personal Expenses<br>Guide Tips (as you wish)</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-03 23:52:33', '2026-06-15 03:14:18'),
(4, 'Djawatan (Lord Of The Rings)', 'Djawatan (Lord Of The Rings)', 'djawatan-lord-of-the-rings-1778038863', 'tour_packages/93goK0sp70xVqJ7um41CtpNz7SamuJ2fCS5IVyNE.webp', 1, 3, 'Nature Trip', 300000, 500000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7 Jam', '7 Jam', '<p>Hutan De Djawatan</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati indahnya pohon trembesi yang dikenal dengan sebutan Lord Of The Rings</p>', '<p>Enjoy the beauty of the savanna (Africa Van Java) and Bama beach</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotels in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Points in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Saturday &amp; Sunday (weekend)</p>', '<p><strong>08:30</strong> Penjemputan Open Trip Djawatan di penginapan sekitar Banyuwangi Kota&nbsp;<br><strong>09:30</strong> Menikmati kawasan area Hutan Djawatan benculuk, explore keinddahan hutan trembesi berusia ratusan tahun, anda bisa menikmati spot foto yang tersedia&nbsp;<br><strong>10:30</strong> dilanjutkan safari tur berkeliling hutan menaiki rack jeep 4×4 sambil menikmati suasanan hutan yang asri&nbsp;<br><strong>11:30</strong> kembali ke pusat kota dan tour berakhir</p>', '<p><strong>08:30</strong> Penjemputan Open Trip Djawatan di penginapan sekitar Banyuwangi Kota<br><strong>09:30</strong> Menikmati kawasan area Hutan Djawatan benculuk, explore keinddahan hutan trembesi berusia ratusan tahun, anda bisa menikmati spot foto yang tersedia<br><strong>10:30</strong> dilanjutkan safari tur berkeliling hutan menaiki rack jeep 4×4 sambil menikmati suasanan hutan yang asri<br><strong>11:30</strong> kembali ke pusat kota dan tour berakhir</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Transportasi Jeep / trooper selama tour Air mineral Izin dan tiket masuk wisata Guide</p>', '<p>Jeep/trooper transportation during the tour<br>Mineral water<br>Tourist permits and entrance tickets<br>Guide</p>', '<p>Dokumentasi Kamera Makan Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket Tiket pesawat/kereta Asuransi Pengeluaran pribadi</p>', '<p>Camera documentation<br>Meals<br>Foreigner Ticket<br>Airplane/train ticket<br>Insurance<br>Personal expenses</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-05 20:41:03', '2026-06-05 01:48:11'),
(5, 'Taman Nasional Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'Taman Nasional Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'taman-nasional-baluran-afrika-van-java-1778039104', NULL, 1, 3, 'Nature Trip', 300000, 650000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7 Jam', '7 Jam', '<p>Taman Nasional Baluran</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati indahnya savana yang luas dengan julukan (Afrika Van Java) dan pantai bama.</p>', '<p>Enjoy the beauty of the vast savanna with the nickname (Africa Van Java) and Bama beach.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Banyuwangi City Area Hotels / Banyuwangi City Meeting Points</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>13:00</strong> Penjemputan di Banyuwangi Kota</p><p><strong>13:30</strong> Menuju Taman Nasional Baluran&nbsp;</p><p><strong>15:00</strong> Sampai di Taman Nasional Baluran, Anda akan diajak menikmati keindahan lansekap sanava Bekol lewat menara Pandang dan mengabadikan momen kunjungan Anda di savana Bekol dengan background gunung Baluran&nbsp;</p><p><strong>16:30</strong> Mengunjungi pantai Bama dan mangrove trail&nbsp;</p><p><strong>17:30</strong> Meninggalkan Taman Nasional Baluran, peserta bisa melihat panorama sunset di savana bekol. Jika beruntung anda akan berjumpa dengan satwa endemik seperti rusa, merak hijau, ayam hutan, kerbau liar dll&nbsp;</p><p><strong>18:00</strong> Drop Area Banyuwangi kota dan tour berakhir</p>', '<p><strong>1:00</strong> <strong>PM </strong>Pick-up in Banyuwangi City<br><strong>1:30</strong> <strong>PM </strong>Head to Baluran National Park<br><strong>3:00</strong> <strong>PM </strong>Upon arrival at Baluran National Park, you will be invited to enjoy the beautiful landscape of the Bekol savanna from the observation tower and capture the moments of your visit in the Bekol savanna with Mount Baluran in the background.<br><strong>4:30 PM</strong> Visit Bama Beach and the mangrove trail<br><strong>5:30 PM</strong> Upon leaving Baluran National Park, participants can enjoy a panoramic sunset over the Bekol savanna. If you\'re lucky, you might encounter endemic wildlife such as deer, green peacocks, jungle fowl, wild buffalo, etc.<br><strong>6:00 PM</strong> Drop-off at the Banyuwangi City area and the tour ends.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Transportasi Jeep / trooper selama tour Air mineral Izin dan tiket masuk wisata Guide</p>', '<p>Jeep/trooper transportation during the tour, Mineral water, Tourist permits and entrance tickets, Guide</p>', '<p>Dokumentasi Kamera Makan Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket Tiket pesawat/kereta Asuransi Pengeluaran pribadi</p>', '<p>Camera documentation, Food, Foreign Tourist Ticket, Airplane/train ticket, Insurance, Personal expenses</p>', 11, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-05 20:45:04', '2026-06-05 01:47:44'),
(6, 'Djawatan (Lord Of The Rings) & Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'Djawatan (Lord Of The Rings) & Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'djawatan-lord-of-the-rings-baluran-afrika-van-java-1778039365', 'tour_packages/ltZi4i5NSH69SFqF2eBSFFRiVtaOxcL0zbhjTbiw.webp', 2, 3, 'Nature Trip', 450000, 900000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 Day', '1 Day', '<p>Hutan De Djawatan</p><p>Taman Nasional Baluran</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati indahnya pohon trembesi dikenal dengan sebutan Lord &amp; Menikmati indahnya savana (Afrika Van Java) dan pantai bama</p>', '<p>Enjoy the beauty of the rain tree known as Lord &amp; Enjoy the beauty of the savanna (Africa Van Java) and Bama beach</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Banyuwangi City Area Hotels / Banyuwangi City Meeting Points</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Saturday &amp; Sunday (weekend)</p>', '<p><strong>08:30</strong> Penjemputan di Banyuwangi Kota&nbsp;<br><strong>09:30</strong> Mengunjungi Hutan De Djawatan menikmati indahnya hutan trembesi berusia ratusan tahun seperti latar di film the lord of the rings. Peserta diantar berkeliling menggunakan jeep untuk berfoto di spot2 tertentu.&nbsp;<br><strong>12:30</strong> Menuju Taman Nasional Baluran&nbsp;</p><p><strong>14:00</strong> Sampai di Taman Nasional Baluran, Anda akan diajak menikmati keindahan lansekap sanava Bekol lewat menara Pandang dan mengabadikan momen kunjungan Anda di savana Bekol dengan background gunung Baluran&nbsp;</p><p><strong>15:30</strong> Mengunjungi pantai Bama dan mangrove trail&nbsp;</p><p><strong>16:30</strong> Meninggalkan Taman Nasional Baluran, peserta bisa melihat panorama sunset dari atas jeep safari di sekitaran savana bekol. Jika beruntung anda akan berjumpa dengan satwa endemik seperti rusa, merak hijau, ayam hutan, kerbau liar dll&nbsp;</p><p><strong>18:00 </strong>Drop Area Banyuwangi kota dan tour berakhir</p>', '<p><strong>8:30 AM</strong> Pick-up in Banyuwangi City<br><strong>9:30 AM</strong> Visit De Djawatan Forest to enjoy the beauty of the centuries-old rain tree forest, reminiscent of the setting in The Lord of the Rings. Participants will be taken around by jeep to take photos at selected spots.<br><strong>12:30 PM</strong> Head to Baluran National Park<br><strong>2:00 PM</strong> Arrive at Baluran National Park, where you will be invited to admire the beautiful landscape of the Bekol savanna from the observation tower and capture the moments of your visit in the Bekol savanna with Mount Baluran in the background.<br><strong>3:30 PM</strong> Visit Bama Beach and the mangrove trail<br><strong>4:30 PM</strong> Leave Baluran National Park, and participants can enjoy a panoramic sunset from a jeep safari around the Bekol savanna. If you\'re lucky, you might encounter endemic wildlife such as deer, green peacocks, jungle fowl, wild buffalo, and more.<br><strong>6:00 PM</strong> Drop-off at Banyuwangi City, and the tour ends.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Transportasi Jeep / trooper selama tour Air mineral Izin dan tiket masuk wisata Guide</p>', '<p>Jeep/trooper transportation during the tour<br>Mineral water<br>Tourist permits and entrance tickets<br>Guide</p>', '<p>Dokumentasi Kamera Makan Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket Tiket pesawat/kereta Asuransi Pengeluaran pribadi</p>', '<p>Camera Documentation<br>Meals<br>Foreign Tourist Tickets<br>Airplane/Train Tickets<br>Insurance<br>Personal Expenses</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-05 20:49:25', '2026-06-05 01:47:26'),
(7, 'Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'Baluran (Afrika Van Java)', 'baluran-afrika-van-java-1778127940', 'tour_packages/Szcbunl6G8REC68kd4t6SeLx0nryX7TZhc29eFz3.webp', 1, 3, 'Nature Trip', 300000, 650000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '7 Jam', '7 hours', '<p>Baluran (Afrika Van Java)</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati indahnya savana (<strong>Afrika Van Java</strong>) dan pantai bama</p>', '<p>Enjoy the beauty of the savanna (Africa Van Java) and Bama beach.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotels, Stations, Ports, Banyuwangi City Area/Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Sabtu &amp; Minggu (weekend)</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>13:00</strong> Penjemputan di Banyuwangi Kota<br><strong>13:30</strong> Menuju Taman Nasional Baluran<br><strong>15:00</strong> Sampai di Taman Nasional Baluran, Anda akan diajak menikmati keindahan lansekap sanava Bekol lewat menara Pandang dan mengabadikan momen kunjungan Anda di savana Bekol dengan background gunung Baluran<br><strong>16:30</strong> Mengunjungi pantai Bama dan mangrove trail<br><strong>17:30</strong> Meninggalkan Taman Nasional Baluran, peserta bisa melihat panorama sunset di savana bekol. Jika beruntung anda akan berjumpa dengan satwa endemik seperti rusa, merak hijau, ayam hutan, kerbau liar dll<br><strong>18:00</strong> Drop Area Banyuwangi kota dan tour berakhir</p>', '<p><strong>1:00</strong> PM Pickup in Banyuwangi City<br><strong>1:30</strong> PM Head to Baluran National Park<br><strong>3:00</strong> PM Upon arrival at Baluran National Park, you will be invited to enjoy the beautiful landscape of the Bekol savanna from the observation tower and capture the moments of your visit in the Bekol savanna with Mount Baluran in the background.<br><strong>4:30</strong> PM Visit Bama Beach and the mangrove trail<br><strong>5:30</strong> PM Upon leaving Baluran National Park, participants can witness the panoramic sunset over the Bekol savanna. If you\'re lucky, you might encounter endemic wildlife such as deer, green peacocks, jungle fowl, wild buffalo, and more.<br><strong>6:00 </strong>PM Drop off at the city area and the Banyuwangi tour ends.</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', '<p>Transportasi Jeep / trooper selama tour<br>Air mineral<br>Izin dan tiket masuk wisata<br>Guide</p>', '<p>Jeep/trooper transportation during the tour<br>Mineral water<br>Tourist permits and entrance tickets<br>Guide</p>', '<p>Dokumentasi Kamera<br>Makan<br>Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket<br>Tiket pesawat/kereta<br>Asuransi<br>Pengeluaran pribadi</p>', '<p>Camera Documentation<br>Meals<br>Foreign Tourist Tickets<br>Airplane/Train Tickets<br>Insurance<br>Personal Expenses</p>', 14, '<p>Bank BNI</p>', '<p>Bank BNI</p>', 1, '2026-05-06 21:25:40', '2026-06-05 01:47:12'),
(8, 'Djawatan, Baluran, Kawah Ijen', 'Djawatan, Baluran, Kawah Ijen', 'djawatan-baluran-kawah-ijen-1779197271', 'tour_packages/Xg4HFCPhD5uYDb7KD0lTDaxMM3jVDsC5JmgS9jYt.webp', 3, 3, 'Nature Trip', 2800000, 3950000.00, 1400000, 2200000.00, 950000, 1700000.00, 800000, 1500000.00, 750000, 1450000.00, 600000, 1300000.00, 500000, 1150000.00, '3D2N', '2D1N', '<p>Djawatan, Baluran (Afrika Van Java), Kawah Ijen</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati hutan magis Djawatan yang rindang, savana luas Baluran dengan satwa liar, serta Kawah Ijen dengan api biru memukau. Fasilitas: transportasi kuliner hotel guide</p>', '<p>Enjoy the lush, magical forests of Djawatan, the vast savannah of Baluran with its wildlife, and the Ijen Crater with its stunning blue fire.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Banyuwangi City Hotel Area / Banyuwangi City Meeting Point</p>', '<p>Setiap hari</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Everyday</p>', '<p><strong>Day 1 : Hutan De-Djawatan Banyuwangi &amp; Taman Nasional Baluran</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>08.30</strong> Penjemputan bisa di Stasiun, Terminal, Bandara, Hotel (Area Banyuwangi Kota)<br><strong>09.00</strong> Berangkat menuju Hutan De-Djawatan<br><strong>10.00</strong> Sampai Hutan De-Djawatan (Explore Hutan De-Djawatan, hutan dengan pohon Trembesi tinggi besar yang usianya lebih dari 100 tahun, disebut-sebut mirip hutan di film Lord of The Rings. Kamu bisa foto-foto background hutan dengan pohon yang rindang)<br><strong>12.00</strong> Setelah puas menikmati indahnya Hutan De-Djawatan lanjut perjalanan menuju Taman Nasional Baluran<br><strong>12.30</strong> Mampir makan siang (exclude)<br><strong>13.00 </strong>Lanjut menuju Taman Nasional Baluran<br><strong>14.30 </strong>Sampai Taman Nasional Baluran (Menikmati padang savana terluas di Pulau Jawa melihat berbagai satwa liar hidup bebas di Savana Bekol, explore indahnya Pantai Bama, dan trekking Hutan Mangrove)<br><strong>17.00 </strong>Meninggalkan Taman Nasional Baluran dan menuju Banyuwangi Kota<br><strong>18.30 </strong>Diantar menuju Hotel dan istirahat</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Day 2 : Kawah Ijen Banyuwangi</strong></p><p><strong>00.30 </strong>Penjemputan di Hotel sekitar Banyuwangi kota<br><strong>01.00 </strong>Berangkat menuju Kawah Ijen<br><strong>02.00 </strong>Sampai di Pos Paltuding (Parkiran Kawah Ijen), lanjut trekking 4km puncak Kawah Ijen<br><strong>04.00 </strong>Sampai di puncak (menyaksikan fenomena langka Blue fire atau menikmati indahnya sunrise kawah ijen, melihat kemegahan danau hijau tosca dan berfoto-foto di spot pohon instagramable)<br><strong>06.30 </strong>Kembali ke Pos Paltuding<br><strong>08.00 </strong>Sampai di Paltuding dan kembali menuju hotel<br><strong>09.00 </strong>Sampai di Hotel dan trip selesai</p><p><br>*<strong>Note</strong>: Itinerary tidak baku, bisa request dan menyesuaikan kondisi lapangan</p>', '<p><strong>Day 1: De-Djawatan Forest, Banyuwangi &amp; Baluran National Park</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>8:30 AM</strong> Pickup available at the station, terminal, airport, or hotel (Banyuwangi City area)</p><p><strong>9:00 AM</strong> Depart for De-Djawatan Forest</p><p><strong>10:00 AM</strong> Arrive at De-Djawatan Forest (Explore De-Djawatan Forest, a forest with tall, large rain trees over 100 years old, said to resemble the forest in the Lord of the Rings film. You can take photos with the forest\'s shady background)</p><p><strong>12:00 PM</strong> After enjoying the beauty of De-Djawatan Forest, continue your journey to Baluran National Park.</p><p><strong>12:30 PM </strong>Stop for lunch (excluded)</p><p><strong>1:00 PM </strong>Continue to Baluran National Park</p><p><strong>2:30 PM</strong> Arrive at Baluran National Park (Enjoy the largest savanna on Java, see various wildlife living freely in the Bekol Savannah, explore the beauty of Bama Beach, and go forest trekking) (Mangrove) <strong>5:00 PM</strong> Leave Baluran National Park and head to Banyuwangi City</p><p><strong>6:30 PM</strong> Transfer to hotel and rest</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Day 2: Ijen Crater, Banyuwangi</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>12:30 AM </strong>Pickup at hotel near Banyuwangi City</p><p><strong>1:00 AM</strong> Depart for Ijen Crater</p><p><strong>2:00 AM</strong> Arrive at Paltuding Post (Ijen Crater Parking Area), continue trekking 4 km to the summit of Ijen Crater</p><p><strong>4:00 AM</strong> Arrive at the summit (witness the rare blue fire phenomenon or enjoy the beautiful sunrise at Ijen Crater, see the magnificent turquoise lake, and take photos at the Instagrammable tree spots)</p><p><strong>6:30 AM </strong>Return to Paltuding Post</p><p><strong>8:00 AM </strong>Arrive at Paltuding and return to the hotel</p><p><strong>9:00 AM </strong>Arrive at the hotel and the trip ends *Note: The itinerary is not fixed and can be requested and adjusted to field conditions</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Membayar DP maksimal H-2 minggu sebelum trip selagi kuota masih tersedia<br>Biaya DP 30% sebagai tanda jadi<br>Pelunasan dilakukan di hari pertama trip via transfer<br>Reschedule maksimal H-7 sebelum trip berlangsung dan hanya 1x reschedule<br>Biaya DP tidak bisa di refund bila terjadi pembatalan dari pihak tamu<br>Batas usia minimal 1 tahun maksimal 60 tahun dalam kondisi sehat, tidak memiliki riwayat penyakit jantung atau asma<br>WAJIB membawa surat keterangan sehat dari dokter berlaku 3 hari (persyaratan pendakian Kawah Ijen)<br>Apabila destinasi tidak memungkinkan untuk dikunjungi karena penutupan, cuaca yang tidak mendukung dan lain-lain peserta trip tidak berhak meminta kompensasi<br>Peserta yang telah mendaftar dianggap mengerti dan sepakat dengan syarat dan ketentuan diatas.<br>Peralatan yang perlu dibawa: Alat snorkeling dan masker gas/respirator bagi yang punya (mengantisipasi peralatan yang kami sediakan tidak sesuai standard Anda), handuk, sandal, sunblock, outfit pantai, topi, obat-obatan pribadi, kacamata hitam, jaket/pakaian hangat, topi kupluk, sarung tangan, Trekking Pole bagi yang punya, kamera bagi yang punya.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>A down payment must be made no later than 2 weeks before the trip, while quotas are still available.</p><p>A 30% down payment is required as a deposit.</p><p>Final payment must be made on the first day of the trip via bank transfer.</p><p>Reschedules can be made no later than 7 days before the trip, with only one reschedule allowed.</p><p>The down payment is non-refundable in the event of a guest cancellation.</p><p>Minimum age limit: 1 year, maximum 60 years, in good health, with no history of heart disease or asthma.</p><p>A doctor\'s health certificate valid for 3 days is required (a requirement for climbing Ijen Crater).</p><p>If the destination cannot be visited due to closures, unfavorable weather, or other trip participants, compensation cannot be requested.</p><p>Registered participants are deemed to understand and agree to the above terms and conditions. Equipment to bring: Snorkeling gear and a gas mask/respirator (if you have one) (in case the equipment we provide does not meet your standards), towel, sandals, sunscreen, beachwear, hat, personal medications, sunglasses, jacket/warm clothing, beanie, gloves, trekking poles (if you have one), and a camera (if you have one).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Guide&nbsp;<br>Mobil selama trip (1-4 pax pakai Avanza/Xenia, 5-6 pakai Innova, 7-12 pakai Hiace)<br>Driver<br>BBM<br>Semua Tiket Masuk<br>Air mineral<br>Masker Gas Kawah Ijen<br>Senter/Headlamp</p>', '<p>Guide</p><p>Car during the trip (Avanza/Xenia for 1-4 people, Innova for 5-6 people, Hiace for 7-12 people)</p><p>Driver</p><p>Fuel</p><p>All entrance fees</p><p>Mineral water</p><p>Ijen Crater gas masks</p><p>Flashlight/Headlamp</p>', '<p>Makan (Bisa kita rekomendasikan makanan khas Banyuwangi)<br>Tiket WNA / Foreign Tourist Ticket<br>Hotel<br>Tiket pesawat/kereta<br>Asuransi<br>Pengeluaran pribadi<br>Tips guide (seikhlasnya)</p>', '<p>Meals (We can recommend Banyuwangi specialties)</p><p>Foreign Tourist Ticket</p><p>Hotel</p><p>Airplane/Train Ticket</p><p>Insurance</p><p>Personal Expenses</p><p>Guide Tips (as you wish)</p>', 14, '<p>-</p>', '<p>-</p>', 1, '2026-05-19 06:27:53', '2026-06-05 12:58:32'),
(9, 'Kawah Wurung Trip', 'Kawah Wurung Trip', 'kawah-wurung-trip-1781494352', 'tour_packages/FxLcpdCw3mk4o5TSPAPskKG9qyHuBRmZNMWWWN90.webp', 1, 3, 'Nature Trip', 450000, 700000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '6 Jam', '6 hours', '<p>Kawah Wurung</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menyambut pagi di tengah savana hijau yang luas, ditemani semburat cahaya sunrise yang mempercantik setiap sudut pemandangan. Udara pegunungan yang sejuk dan segar menambah kenyamanan saat menikmati hamparan padang rumput yang membentang tanpa batas. Perlahan, sinar matahari yang muncul dari balik perbukitan menciptakan gradasi warna yang memukau, menghadirkan suasana tenang dan menenangkan. Momen ini menjadi pengalaman istimewa bagi para pencinta alam, sekaligus kesempatan sempurna untuk mengabadikan keindahan lanskap yang eksotis dan mempesona.</p>', '<p>Greet the morning amidst a vast green savanna, accompanied by the faint glow of sunrise that beautifies every corner of the view. The cool, fresh mountain air adds to the comfort of enjoying the endless expanse of grassland. Slowly, the sun\'s rays emerge from behind the hills, creating a stunning gradation of colors, creating a serene and calming atmosphere. This moment is a special experience for nature lovers, as well as the perfect opportunity to capture the exotic and enchanting beauty of the landscape.</p>', '<p>Jadwal keberangkatan <strong>Open Trip</strong> kami dikoordinasikan secara fleksibel demi memastikan kenyamanan perjalanan terbaik Anda. Jangan khawatir, tim <strong>Kutamasya</strong> akan selalu mendampingi secara aktif dan mengonfirmasi jadwal final terbaik untuk Anda sebelum hari keberangkatan.&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Our Open Trip departure schedules are flexibly coordinated to ensure your ultimate travel experience. Don\'t worry, the Kutamasya team will always be actively assisting you and confirming the best final itinerary for you before departure.</p>', '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>03:30</strong> Penjemputan di penginapan sekitar Banyuwangi Kota<br><strong>04:00</strong> Perjalanan menuju kawah wurung melewati paltuding sekitar kawah ijen<br><strong>05:00</strong> tiba di kawasan area Wisata Kawah Wurung, anda bisa menunggu waktu sunrise dengan pemandangan kaldera purba Ijen.<br><strong>06:00</strong> Anda bisa mengexplore kawasan spot foto hingga puncak kawah wurung dari menara pandang dengan menaiki anak tangga sekitar 15 menit. Dilanjutkan safari tur ke area savana Kawah Wurung.<br><strong>08:30</strong> kembali ke pusat Banyuwangi kota, drop kembali menuju hotel<br><strong>09:30</strong> tour berakhir</p>', '<p><strong>03:30</strong> Pickup at your accommodation near Banyuwangi City<br><strong>04:00</strong> Journey to Kawah Wurung via Paltuding around Ijen Crater<br><strong>05:00</strong> Arrive at the Kawah Wurung tourist area, where you can await the sunrise with views of the ancient Ijen caldera.<br><strong>06:00</strong> Explore the photo spots and reach the summit of Kawah Wurung from the observation tower, climbing the stairs for about 15 minutes. Continue on a safari tour to the Kawah Wurung savanna area.<br><strong>8:30</strong> AM Return to downtown Banyuwangi, drop off at your hotel.<br><strong>9:30</strong> AM Tour ends.</p>', '<p>- Membayar DP maksimal H-2 minggu sebelum trip selagi kuota masih tersedia<br>Biaya DP 30% sebagai tanda jadi<br>- Pelunasan dilakukan di hari pertama trip via transfer<br>- Reschedule maksimal H-7 sebelum trip berlangsung dan hanya 1x reschedule<br>- Biaya DP tidak bisa di refund bila terjadi pembatalan dari pihak tamu<br>- Batas usia minimal 1 tahun maksimal 60 tahun dalam kondisi sehat, tidak memiliki riwayat penyakit jantung atau asma<br>- WAJIB membawa surat keterangan sehat dari dokter berlaku 3 hari (persyaratan pendakian Kawah Ijen)<br>- Apabila destinasi tidak memungkinkan untuk dikunjungi karena penutupan, cuaca yang tidak mendukung dan lain-lain peserta trip tidak berhak meminta kompensasi<br>Peserta yang telah mendaftar dianggap mengerti dan sepakat dengan syarat dan ketentuan diatas.<br>- Peralatan yang perlu dibawa: Alat snorkeling dan masker gas/respirator bagi yang punya (mengantisipasi peralatan yang kami sediakan tidak sesuai standard Anda), handuk, sandal, sunblock, outfit pantai, topi, obat-obatan pribadi, kacamata hitam, jaket/pakaian hangat, topi kupluk, sarung tangan, Trekking Pole bagi yang punya, kamera bagi yang punya.</p><ul><li>&nbsp;</li></ul>', '<p>- Down payment up to 2 weeks before the trip, while quotas are still available.<br>30% down payment as a deposit.<br>- Full payment is due on the first day of the trip via bank transfer.<br>- Reschedule up to 7 days before the trip, with only one reschedule allowed.<br>- The down payment is non-refundable in the event of a cancellation by the guest.<br>- Minimum age limit: 1 year and maximum: 60 years old, in good health, with no history of heart disease or asthma.<br>- A medical certificate valid for 3 days is required (required for climbing Ijen Crater).<br>- If the destination cannot be visited due to closures, unfavorable weather, or Other trip participants are not entitled to request compensation.<br>Participants who have registered are deemed to understand and agree to the terms and conditions above.<br>- Equipment to bring: Snorkeling gear and a gas mask/respirator (if you have one) (in case the equipment we provide doesn\'t meet your standards), towel, sandals, sunscreen, beachwear, hat, personal medication, sunglasses, jacket/warm clothing, beanie, gloves, trekking poles (if you have one), and a camera (if you have one).</p>', '<p>- Transportasi Jeep selama tour<br>- Air mineral<br>- Izin dan tiket masuk wisata<br>- Guide</p>', '<p>- Jeep transportation during the tour<br>- Mineral water<br>- Tourist permits and entrance tickets<br>- Guide</p>', '<p>- Pengeluaran pribadi<br>- Tip sukarela<br>- Dokumentasi bisa minta tolong ke guide</p>', '<p>- Personal expenses<br>- Voluntary tips<br>- Documentation can be requested from the guide.</p>', 14, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-15 03:32:32', '2026-06-16 16:36:01'),
(10, 'Kawah Wurung & Djawatan', 'Kawah Wurung & Djawatan', 'kawah-wurung-djawatan-1781495701', 'tour_packages/vtkOaHMbqvMCyuUFG9LPylsqsDMnzDbI3hPMD8Yw.webp', 2, 3, 'Nature Trip', 600000, 950000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 hari', '1 Day', '<p>Kawah wurung &amp; djawatan</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati padang savana luas dengan bukit hijau indah dan udara sejuk alami., &nbsp;dan menikmati hutan trembesi rindang dengan suasana magis, teduh, dan spot foto yang menarik.</p>', '<p>Enjoy the vast savanna with beautiful green hills and natural cool air, and enjoy the shady rain forest with a magical, shady atmosphere and interesting photo spots.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>03:30</strong> Penjemputan Open Trip Kawah Wurung &amp; Djawatan di penginapan sekitar Banyuwangi Kota<br><strong>04:00</strong> Perjalanan menuju kawah wurung melewati paltuding sekitar kawah ijen<br><strong>05:00</strong> tiba di kawasan area Wisata Kawah Wurung, anda bisa menunggu waktu sunrise dengan pemandangan kaldera purba Ijen.<br><strong>06:00</strong> Anda bisa mengexplore kawasan spot foto hingga puncak kawah wurung dari menara pandang dengan menaiki anak tangga sekitar 15 menit. Dilanjutkan safari tur ke area savana Kawah Wurung.<br><strong>07:30</strong> kembali ke pusat Banyuwangi kota, drop kembali menuju hotel<br><strong>09:00</strong> istirahat di hotel<br><strong>10:00</strong> Penjemputan tour di Hotel<br><strong>11:00</strong> Menikmati kawasan area Hutan Djawatan benculuk, explore keinddahan hutan trembesi berusia ratusan tahun, dilanjutkan safari tur berkeliling hutan menaiki jeep.<br><strong>12:30</strong> kembali ke pusat kota.<br><strong>13:30</strong> drop di hotel tour berakhir.</p>', '<p><strong>3:30 AM</strong> Pickup for the Kawah Wurung &amp; Djawatan Open Trip at your accommodation near Banyuwangi City.<br><strong>4:00 AM</strong> Journey to Kawah Wurung via Paltuding (a small bridge) near Ijen Crater.<br><strong>5:00 AM</strong> Arrival at the Kawah Wurung tourist area, where you can wait for the sunrise with views of the ancient Ijen caldera.<br><strong>6:00 AM</strong> Explore the photo spots up to the top of Kawah Wurung from the observation tower by climbing the stairs for about 15 minutes. Continue on a safari tour of the Kawah Wurung savanna area.<br><strong>7:30 AM</strong> Return to downtown Banyuwangi and drop off at your hotel.<br><strong>9:00 AM</strong> Rest at your hotel.<br><strong>10:00 AM</strong> Tour pickup at your hotel.<br><strong>11:00 AM</strong> Enjoy the Djawatan Benculuk Forest area, explore the beauty of the centuries-old rain tree forest, and continue on a safari tour around the forest by jeep.<br><strong>12:30 PM</strong> Return to the city center.<br><strong>1:30 PM</strong> Drop off at your hotel. The tour concludes.</p>', '<p>- Membayar DP maksimal H-2 minggu sebelum trip selagi kuota masih tersedia<br>Biaya DP 30% sebagai tanda jadi<br>- Pelunasan dilakukan di hari pertama trip via transfer<br>- Reschedule maksimal H-7 sebelum trip berlangsung dan hanya 1x reschedule<br>- Biaya DP tidak bisa di refund bila terjadi pembatalan dari pihak tamu<br>- Batas usia minimal 1 tahun maksimal 60 tahun dalam kondisi sehat, tidak memiliki riwayat penyakit jantung atau asma<br>- WAJIB membawa surat keterangan sehat dari dokter berlaku 3 hari (persyaratan pendakian Kawah Ijen)<br>- Apabila destinasi tidak memungkinkan untuk dikunjungi karena penutupan, cuaca yang tidak mendukung dan lain-lain peserta trip tidak berhak meminta kompensasi<br>Peserta yang telah mendaftar dianggap mengerti dan sepakat dengan syarat dan ketentuan diatas.<br>- Peralatan yang perlu dibawa: Alat snorkeling dan masker gas/respirator bagi yang punya (mengantisipasi peralatan yang kami sediakan tidak sesuai standard Anda), handuk, sandal, sunblock, outfit pantai, topi, obat-obatan pribadi, kacamata hitam, jaket/pakaian hangat, topi kupluk, sarung tangan, Trekking Pole bagi yang punya, kamera bagi yang punya.</p>', '<p>- Down payment up to 2 weeks before the trip, while quotas are still available.<br>30% down payment as a deposit.<br>- Full payment is due on the first day of the trip via bank transfer.<br>- Reschedule up to 7 days before the trip, with only one reschedule allowed.<br>- The down payment is non-refundable in the event of a cancellation by the guest.<br>- Minimum age limit: 1 year and maximum: 60 years old, in good health, with no history of heart disease or asthma.<br>- A medical certificate valid for 3 days is required (required for climbing Ijen Crater).<br>- If the destination cannot be visited due to closures, unfavorable weather, or Other trip participants are not entitled to request compensation.<br>Participants who have registered are deemed to understand and agree to the terms and conditions above.<br>- Equipment to bring: Snorkeling gear and a gas mask/respirator (if you have one) (in case the equipment we provide doesn\'t meet your standards), towel, sandals, sunscreen, beachwear, hat, personal medication, sunglasses, jacket/warm clothing, beanie, gloves, trekking poles (if you have one), and a camera (if you have one).</p>', '<p>- Transportasi Jeep selama tour<br>- Air mineral<br>- Izin dan tiket masuk wisata<br>- Guide</p>', '<p>- Jeep transportation during the tour<br>- Mineral water<br>- Tourist permits and entrance fees<br>- Guide</p>', '<p>- Pengeluaran pribadi<br>- Tip sukarela</p>', '<p>- Personal expenses<br>- Voluntary tips</p>', 1, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-15 03:55:01', '2026-06-15 04:11:45'),
(11, 'Kawah Ijen & Baluran', 'Kawah Ijen & Baluran', 'kawah-ijen-baluran-1781496678', 'tour_packages/ZZLDXi8rE9LrbDHzdNY2g8wkAUuIILERFKrl3fbo.webp', 2, 3, 'Nature Trip', 500000, 105000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 hari', '1 Day', '<p>Kawah Ijen &amp; Baluran</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Menikmati kawah belerang dengan api biru atau blue fire yang unik dan panorama sunrise yang memukau. dan menikmati savana luas dengan satwa liar, pemandangan eksotis, dan suasana alam khas Afrika.</p>', '<p>Enjoy the sulfur crater with its unique blue fire and stunning sunrise panorama. Then, enjoy the vast savannah with its wildlife, exotic scenery, and unique African atmosphere.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>00.30</strong> Penjemputan di Stasiun/Hotel sekitar Banyuwangi kota.<br><strong>01.00</strong> Berangkat menuju Kawah Ijen.<br><strong>02.00</strong> Sampai di Pos Paltuding (parkiran Kawah Ijen), lanjut trekking menuju puncak Kawah Ijen.<br><strong>04.00</strong> Sampai di puncak Kawah Ijen(menyaksikan fenomena langka Blue fire atau menikmati indahnya sunrise kawah ijen, melihat kemegahan danau hijau tosca dan berfoto-foto di spot pohon instagramable)<br><strong>06.30</strong> Kembali ke Pos Paltuding<br><strong>08.00</strong> Sampai di Pos Paltuding<br><strong>09.00</strong> Istirahat sebentar dan Makan<br><strong>09.30</strong> Menuju Baluran National Park<br><strong>12.30</strong> Sampai Baluran National Park<br><strong>13.00</strong> Explore Taman Nasional Baluran (Menikmati padang savana terluas di Pulau Jawa melihat berbagai satwa liar hidup bebas di Savana Bekol, explore indahnya Pantai Bama, dan trekking Hutan Mangrove)<br><strong>15.00 </strong>Meninggalkan Baluran National Park dan kembali ke Banyuwangi Kota.<br><strong>16.30</strong> Diantar menuju stasiun/hotel dan Selesai.</p>', '<p><strong>12:30 AM</strong> Pickup at the station/hotel near Banyuwangi city.<br><strong>1:00 AM </strong>Depart for Ijen Crater.<br><strong>2:00 AM</strong> Arrive at Paltuding Post (Ijen Crater parking lot), continue trekking to the summit.</p><p><strong>4:00 AM</strong> Arrive at the summit of Ijen Crater (witness the rare blue fire phenomenon or enjoy the beautiful sunrise at the crater, admire the magnificent turquoise lake, and take photos at the Instagrammable tree spots)<br><strong>6:30 AM</strong> Return to Paltuding Post<br><strong>8:00 AM</strong> Arrive at Paltuding Post<br><strong>9:00 AM </strong>Take a short break and eat<br><strong>9:30 AM</strong> Head to Baluran National Park<br><strong>12:30 PM</strong> Arrive at Baluran National Park<br><strong>1:00 PM</strong> Explore Baluran National Park (Enjoy the largest savanna on Java, see various wildlife living freely in the Bekol Savannah, explore the beauty of Bama Beach, and trek through the mangrove forest)<br><strong>3:00 PM</strong> Leave Baluran National Park and return to Banyuwangi City.<br><strong>4:30 PM</strong> Transfer to the station/hotel and finish.</p>', '<p>- Membayar DP maksimal H-2 minggu sebelum trip selagi kuota masih tersedia<br>Biaya DP 30% sebagai tanda jadi<br>- Pelunasan dilakukan di hari pertama trip via transfer<br>- Reschedule maksimal H-7 sebelum trip berlangsung dan hanya 1x reschedule<br>- Biaya DP tidak bisa di refund bila terjadi pembatalan dari pihak tamu<br>- Batas usia minimal 1 tahun maksimal 60 tahun dalam kondisi sehat, tidak memiliki riwayat penyakit jantung atau asma<br>- WAJIB membawa surat keterangan sehat dari dokter berlaku 3 hari (persyaratan pendakian Kawah Ijen)<br>- Apabila destinasi tidak memungkinkan untuk dikunjungi karena penutupan, cuaca yang tidak mendukung dan lain-lain peserta trip tidak berhak meminta kompensasi<br>Peserta yang telah mendaftar dianggap mengerti dan sepakat dengan syarat dan ketentuan diatas.<br>- Peralatan yang perlu dibawa: Alat snorkeling dan masker gas/respirator bagi yang punya (mengantisipasi peralatan yang kami sediakan tidak sesuai standard Anda), handuk, sandal, sunblock, outfit pantai, topi, obat-obatan pribadi, kacamata hitam, jaket/pakaian hangat, topi kupluk, sarung tangan, Trekking Pole bagi yang punya, kamera bagi yang punya.</p>', '<p>- Down payment up to 2 weeks before the trip, while quotas are still available.<br>30% down payment as a deposit.<br>- Full payment is due on the first day of the trip via bank transfer.<br>- Reschedule up to 7 days before the trip, with only one reschedule allowed.<br>- The down payment is non-refundable in the event of a cancellation by the guest.<br>- Minimum age limit: 1 year and maximum: 60 years old, in good health, with no history of heart disease or asthma.<br>- A medical certificate valid for 3 days is required (required for climbing Ijen Crater).<br>- If the destination cannot be visited due to closures, unfavorable weather, or Other trip participants are not entitled to request compensation.<br>Participants who have registered are deemed to understand and agree to the terms and conditions above.<br>- Equipment to bring: Snorkeling gear and a gas mask/respirator (if you have one) (in case the equipment we provide doesn\'t meet your standards), towel, sandals, sunscreen, beachwear, hat, personal medication, sunglasses, jacket/warm clothing, beanie, gloves, trekking poles (if you have one), and a camera (if you have one).</p>', '<p>- Mobil selama trip<br>- Driver<br>- BBM<br>- Local Guide Ijen<br>- Tiket Masuk<br>- Masker gas &amp; Senter<br>- Air mineral</p>', '<p>- Car during the trip<br>- Driver<br>- Fuel<br>- Local Ijen Guide<br>- Entrance Ticket<br>- Gas Mask &amp; Flashlight<br>- Mineral Water</p>', '<p>- Tiket pesawat/kereta<br>- Tiket WNA<br>- Asuransi<br>- Pengeluaran pribadi<br>- Tips guide (Seikhlasnya)</p>', '<p>- Airplane/Train Ticket<br>- Foreign National Ticket<br>- Insurance<br>- Personal Expenses<br>- Guide Tips (as you wish)</p>', 14, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-06-15 04:11:18', '2026-06-15 04:11:18'),
(12, 'Djawatan, Green Island, Pulau Merah', 'Djawatan, Green Island, Pulau Merah', 'djawatan-green-island-pulau-merah-1781497398', 'tour_packages/knNuD1vInfITxh064y0o03MRBqpIniIp2gCH14N6.webp', 2, 3, 'Nature Trip', 450000, 750000.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1 hari', '1 Day', '<p>Djawatan, Green Island, Pulau Merah &nbsp;</p>', 'Banyuwangi', '<p>Kamu akan di ajak menikmati 3 destinasi wisata pada trip ini, yaitu menikmati keindahan hutan magis Djawatan yang rindang dengan deretan pohon trembesi raksasa yang menciptakan suasana bak negeri fantasi, dilanjutkan dengan mengagumi pesona Green Island yang eksotis dengan pemandangan alam yang memukau dan udara yang menyegarkan. Perjalanan semakin lengkap dengan mengunjungi Pantai Pulau Merah yang terkenal akan hamparan pasirnya yang indah, ombak yang menawan, serta panorama sunset spektakuler yang menghadirkan semburat warna keemasan di cakrawala. Kombinasi wisata alam, keindahan pantai, dan spot foto yang instagramable menjadikan pengalaman perjalanan ini tak terlupakan.</p>', '<p>Enjoy the lush beauty of the magical Djawatan forest, lined with giant rain trees that create a fantasy-like atmosphere. Then, admire the exotic charm of Green Island, with its stunning natural scenery and refreshing air. Complete your trip with a visit to Pulau Merah Beach, renowned for its beautiful stretch of sand, captivating waves, and spectacular sunsets that cast a golden glow over the horizon. The combination of natural attractions, beautiful beaches, and Instagrammable photo spots makes this trip an unforgettable experience.</p>', NULL, NULL, '<p>Hotel Area Banyuwangi Kota / Meeting Point Banyuwangi Kota</p>', '<p>Hotel in Banyuwangi City Area / Meeting Point in Banyuwangi City</p>', '<p>Setiap Hari</p>', '<p>Every Day</p>', '<p><strong>08.00</strong> Penjemputan bisa di Stasiun, Terminal, Bandara, Hotel<br><strong>08.15</strong> Berangkat menuju Hutan De-Djawatan<br><strong>09.00</strong> Sampai Hutan De-Djawatan (Explore Hutan De-Djawatan, hutan dengan pohon Trembesi tinggi besar yang usianya lebih dari 100 tahun, disebut-sebut mirip hutan di film Lord of The Rings. Kamu bisa foto-foto background hutan dengan pohon yang rindang)<br><strong>10.30</strong> Meninggalkan Hutan De-Djawatan dan menuju Pantai Mustika untuk melanjutkan ke Green Island (menyebrang naik perahu nelayan lokal sekitar 15 menit dari Pantai Mustika)<br><strong>11.30</strong> Sampai Green Island Banyuwangi dilanjutkan trekking menuju spot puncak untuk melihat miniatur Raja Ampat nya Banyuwangi<br><strong>12.00</strong> Sampai puncak Green Island (Menikmati indahnya miniatur Raja Ampat dari puncak dan foto-foto)<br><strong>13.00</strong> Turun dari Spot Puncak Green Island dan kembali menuju Pantai Mustika<br><strong>13.30</strong> Sampai Pantai Mustika dan makan siang (exclude)<br><strong>14.30</strong> Meninggalkan Pantai Mustika dan menuju Pantai Pulau Merah Banyuwangi<br><strong>15.00</strong> Sampai di Pantai Pulau Merah (explore Pantai Pulau Merah dan berfoto-foto, disuguhkan view sunset yang menawan)<br><strong>17.00</strong> Meninggalkan Pulau Merah<br><strong>18.00</strong> Makan Malam (exclude)<br><strong>19.30</strong> Drop off di Stasiun, Terminal, Bandara, Hotel dan Selesai</p>', '<p><strong>8:00 AM</strong> Pickup available at the station, terminal, airport, or hotel.<br><strong>8:15 AM</strong> Depart for De-Djawatan Forest.<br><strong>9:00 AM</strong> Arrive at De-Djawatan Forest. (Explore De-Djawatan Forest, a forest with tall, tall, and 100-year-old rain trees, said to resemble the forest in the Lord of the Rings films. You can take photos with the forest in the background and the shady trees.)<br><strong>10:30 AM</strong> Leave De-Djawatan Forest and head to Mustika Beach to continue to Green Island (a 15-minute local fishing boat ride from Mustika Beach).<br><strong>11:30 AM</strong> Arrive at Green Island Banyuwangi and continue trekking to the summit to see a 